==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - head:
      "10":
        - type: css
        - attributes:
            media: screen
        - file: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/styles.css
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like id, data-role, data-action, media
